{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"variable-sortfns","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Variable: sortFns"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"const sortFns: object;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/sortFns.ts#L357","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/row-sorting/sortFns.ts:357"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The built-in sorting function registry."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Registering this full object opts out of tree-shaking: every built-in\nsorting function ends up in your bundle. Prefer importing the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFn_*"},{"type":"text","value":"\nfunctions you actually use and registering just those in the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFns"},{"type":"text","value":"\nslot, or passing them directly to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFn"},{"type":"text","value":" column option."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-declaration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Declaration"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"alphanumeric","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"alphanumeric"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"alphanumeric: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_alphanumeric;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"alphanumericcasesensitive","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"alphanumericCaseSensitive"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"alphanumericCaseSensitive: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_alphanumericCaseSensitive;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"basic","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"basic"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"basic: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_basic;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"datetime","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"datetime"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"datetime: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_datetime;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"text","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"text"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"text: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_text;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"textcasesensitive","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"text","value":"textCaseSensitive"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"textCaseSensitive: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_textCaseSensitive;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"deprecated","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deprecated"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import individual "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFn_*"},{"type":"text","value":" functions instead for a smaller\nbundle. This export still works and is not going away in v9, but built-in\nname resolution (including "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sortFn: 'auto'"},{"type":"text","value":") only finds functions you\nregister yourself."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"variable-sortfns","text":"Variable: sortFns","level":1},{"id":"type-declaration","text":"Type Declaration","level":2},{"id":"alphanumeric","text":"alphanumeric","level":3},{"id":"alphanumericcasesensitive","text":"alphanumericCaseSensitive","level":3},{"id":"basic","text":"basic","level":3},{"id":"datetime","text":"datetime","level":3},{"id":"text","text":"text","level":3},{"id":"textcasesensitive","text":"textCaseSensitive","level":3},{"id":"deprecated","text":"Deprecated","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# ~~Variable: sortFns~~\n\n```ts\nconst sortFns: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/sortFns.ts:357](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/sortFns.ts#L357)\n\nThe built-in sorting function registry.\n\nRegistering this full object opts out of tree-shaking: every built-in\nsorting function ends up in your bundle. Prefer importing the `sortFn_*`\nfunctions you actually use and registering just those in the `sortFns`\nslot, or passing them directly to the `sortFn` column option.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### ~~alphanumeric~~\n\n```ts\nalphanumeric: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_alphanumeric;\n```\n\n### ~~alphanumericCaseSensitive~~\n\n```ts\nalphanumericCaseSensitive: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_alphanumericCaseSensitive;\n```\n\n### ~~basic~~\n\n```ts\nbasic: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_basic;\n```\n\n### ~~datetime~~\n\n```ts\ndatetime: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_datetime;\n```\n\n### ~~text~~\n\n```ts\ntext: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_text;\n```\n\n### ~~textCaseSensitive~~\n\n```ts\ntextCaseSensitive: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_textCaseSensitive;\n```\n\n## Deprecated\n\nImport individual `sortFn_*` functions instead for a smaller\nbundle. This export still works and is not going away in v9, but built-in\nname resolution (including `sortFn: 'auto'`) only finds functions you\nregister yourself.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: sortFns\ntitle: sortFns\n---\n\n# ~~Variable: sortFns~~\n\n```ts\nconst sortFns: object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/row-sorting/sortFns.ts:357](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/row-sorting/sortFns.ts#L357)\n\nThe built-in sorting function registry.\n\nRegistering this full object opts out of tree-shaking: every built-in\nsorting function ends up in your bundle. Prefer importing the `sortFn_*`\nfunctions you actually use and registering just those in the `sortFns`\nslot, or passing them directly to the `sortFn` column option.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### ~~alphanumeric~~\n\n```ts\nalphanumeric: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_alphanumeric;\n```\n\n### ~~alphanumericCaseSensitive~~\n\n```ts\nalphanumericCaseSensitive: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_alphanumericCaseSensitive;\n```\n\n### ~~basic~~\n\n```ts\nbasic: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_basic;\n```\n\n### ~~datetime~~\n\n```ts\ndatetime: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_datetime;\n```\n\n### ~~text~~\n\n```ts\ntext: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_text;\n```\n\n### ~~textCaseSensitive~~\n\n```ts\ntextCaseSensitive: CreatedSortFn<any, any> = sortFn_textCaseSensitive;\n```\n\n## Deprecated\n\nImport individual `sortFn_*` functions instead for a smaller\nbundle. This export still works and is not going away in v9, but built-in\nname resolution (including `sortFn: 'auto'`) only finds functions you\nregister yourself.\n"}
